      "name": "Run credential harvesting tool in memory via PowerShell",
      "description": "Harvest credentials without writing the harvesting tool to disk. PowerShell scripts load and run the credential harvesting tool in memory, out of reach of file-based detection. Published by MITRE ATT&CK as a procedure example of the 2016 Ukraine Electric Power Attack (C0025) for T1059.001; the source gives no command line.",
