      "modified": "2026-07-28T07:22:00.000Z",
      "name": "Inject DLL into running process via mavinject",
      "description": "Run code inside a legitimate running process. PowerShell starts notepad.exe, then runs the Windows utility mavinject.exe with /INJECTRUNNING to load T1055.001.dll into it; a message box shows from notepad and the test then stops the process. Atomic Red Team test 74496461-11a1-4982-b439-4d87a550d254 for T1055.001; it needs administrator rights and the DLL on disk.",
      "platforms": [
        "Windows"
      ],
