      "modified": "2026-07-28T07:22:00.000Z",
      "name": "Get SYSTEM shell via UsoClient DLL load",
      "description": "Escalate to a SYSTEM shell from a PowerShell session. PowerShell downloads Get-UsoClientDLLSystem.ps1 from GitHub with Net.WebClient and runs it in memory with IEX; the script uses the UsoClient DLL load technique to bind a SYSTEM shell. Atomic Red Team test 8b56f787-73d9-4f1d-87e8-d07e89cbc7f5 for T1055.001, run through a WinPwn function; it needs outbound access to GitHub.",
